<title>LATVIA: MOST LEADING SHARES DOWN,DAUGAVPILS JUMPS.</title>
<headline>MOST LEADING SHARES DOWN,DAUGAVPILS JUMPS.</headline>
<dateline>RIGA 1997-05-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Most official list shares and</p>
<p>secondary list blue chips fell at the morning price setting</p>
<p>session on the bourse on Friday while Daugavpils jumped to 2.40</p>
<p>lats from 2.25 lats.</p>
<p>Staburadze was also among the few gainers as it added three</p>
<p>santimes to 2.65 lats.</p>
